      "R5_RISING_LANDSLIDE",
      "R6_ENV_PRECURSOR",
      "R7_JOINT_MODERATE"
    ]
  },
  "coupled_probability_definition": "noisy-OR: 1 - (1 - p_flood)(1 - p_landslide). Assumes conditional independence, which is only an approximation since both hazards share rainfall drivers. Used for ranking, not as a calibrated joint probability.",
